  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "分发点",
      "items": [
        "do_dentry_open() 在打开时调用 f_op->open()",
        "vfs_read() 优先 f_op->read()，否则 new_sync_read() → read_iter()",
        "do_vfs_ioctl() 未命中命令再走 vfs_ioctl() → unlocked_ioctl()",
        "__fput() 在最后一次引用释放时调用 f_op->release()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "示例驱动",
      "items": [
        "本图用 ppdev 的 pp_fops，open/read/unlocked_ioctl/release 齐全",
        "只提供 read_iter() 的驱动走 new_sync_read()（fs/read_write.c:483）",
        "/dev/urandom 的 random_fops 提供 read_iter()（drivers/char/random.c:1555）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "返回值",
      "items": [
        "open 返回 0 或负 errno",
        "read 返回读取字节数，ioctl 返回 0 或 -errno",
        "release 在文件最后一次关闭后触发，不直接面向系统调用返回"
      ]
    }
  ]
